5. FONTS, DATA AND MEDIA

- Barlow, JetBrains Mono and STIX Two Text fonts (site/fonts/, each with its OFL text beside it). SIL Open Font
  License 1.1.
- UCI Room Occupancy Estimation data set, CC BY 4.0, used to train the occupancy models in
  mspm0g5187/ and the code built from them. Cite as: Singh, A. & Chaudhari, S. (2018). Room Occupancy Estimation
  [Dataset]. UCI Machine Learning Repository. https://doi.org/10.24432/C5P605. The data was converted to windows and
  used to train; the data set itself is not in this repository.
- Audio tracks in portability/boosterpacks/audio/tracks/ (IMA ADPCM, cut and filtered from recordings on Wikimedia
  Commons and Musopen; each .json beside a track holds the source page, license and checksum). Night on Bald
  Mountain (Musopen), Danse macabre (Philadelphia Orchestra, Leopold Stokowski, Victor 6505, 1925), In the Hall of
  the Mountain King (Musopen Symphony, 2012) and Toccata in D minor (Ashtar Moira, c. 2006) are public domain as the
  source pages state. Funeral March of a Marionette (rec_marionette.ima and rec_marionette.json; San Francisco
  Symphony, Alfred Hertz, HMV D1286): recording date unknown; status unverified. The source page lists it as public
  domain but gives no recording date, so its US public-domain status has not been confirmed.
- portability/h264/streams/bbb-640x360.h264. The first 30 pictures of a clip from "Big Buck Bunny", (c) copyright
  2008, Blender Foundation, www.bigbuckbunny.org, licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). Cut from the clip in the h264bsd repository's test folder and
  re-encoded to a raw H.264 stream; no endorsement by the Blender Foundation is implied.

6. BOARD DRAWINGS

Wiring pictures for the Texas Instruments kits are drawn on figures from the kits' public user's guides, which TI
owns; each picture's caption and its credit file name the guide and the figure. They teach one step on that product and
are being replaced, board by board, by this project's own photographs. Pictures based on other makers' documents are
not included.
